WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.370 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Prepare a paper trade before acting.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.140 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Open Trade, and check the

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.709 line:92% position:50% size:90%
instrument you are viewing.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.748 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Choose Buy or Sell deliberately.

00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:15.803 line:92% position:50% size:90%
We will use Buy.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.830 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Check the order type.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.480 line:92% position:50% size:90%
This example uses Market.

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:25.293 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Set the lot size. This

00:00:25.293 --> 00:00:27.407 line:92% position:50% size:90%
is an illustrative practice account.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.508 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Enable Stop Loss, then enter

00:00:31.508 --> 00:00:33.370 line:92% position:50% size:90%
your exercise's stop level.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.071 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Enable Take Profit, then

00:00:37.071 --> 00:00:38.962 line:92% position:50% size:90%
enter your exercise's target.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.467 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Pause to review the

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.754 line:92% position:50% size:90%
estimated loss and margin.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.242 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Reduce the lot size, and

00:00:49.242 --> 00:00:51.304 line:92% position:50% size:90%
check how the estimate changes.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:56.503 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Recheck direction, size, stop and

00:00:56.503 --> 00:00:59.162 line:92% position:50% size:90%
target. These are estimates.

00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:02.004 line:92% position:50% size:90%
Stop here with the prepared

00:01:02.004 --> 00:01:04.286 line:92% position:50% size:90%
ticket. No order was submitted.
